        "attribution": "Liu and Nagel gave the central formulation and made jamming a coherent physical problem.",
        "maturity": "A large body of simulations, theory, and experiments has established the phenomenon and its scaling structure.",
        "uncertainties": ["The boundary between jamming, glass formation, and related rigidity transitions remains actively debated."]
      }
    },
